OL,3,GNEWSA'You cannot build this car
OL,4,Aanywhere else in the world'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDaniel Davey, Longbow's co-chief
OL,7,Fexecutive officer, said the region was
OL,8,Fthe best place to build the cars. "It's
OL,9,Fnot just the supply chain; you've got
OL,10,Fthe talent here and the know-how," he
OL,11,Fsaid.
